  "title": "H.264: Prevent UB with delta scale",
  "description": "H.264 7.4.2.1.1 Scaling list semantics\n\"The value of delta_scale shall be in the range of −128 to +127, inclusive.\"\n\nCheck for a too large value and perform the mod 256 operation before\nadding in that case to prevent UB.\n\nAlso fix indentation, which is inconsistent with the rest of the file.\n\nFix #20714",
